Activating this talent enhances your reflexes to incredible levels.  Each time you are attacked in melee, you have a [12%, 19%, 23%, 26%, 28% (TL1-5)] chance to fire off a defensive shot off in time to intercept the attack, evading it and dealing [37%, 45%, 50%, 55%, 60% (TL1-5)] archery damage.

This cannot damage the same target more than once per turn.
